{"id":"e8b953a1717b11c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Transition Semigroup","display":"df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup — ZFC Prob2 Transition Semigroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup — ZFC Prob2 Transition Semigroup","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup — ZFC Prob2 Transition Semigroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b11853a4f3d4652b\" href=\"?note=b11853a4f3d4652b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,I,P_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,I,P_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S\\)</span> (probability-kernel predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b11853a4f3d4652b\" href=\"?note=b11853a4f3d4652b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S\\)</span> (nonnegative kernel-integral value relation defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_A(x)=1\">\\(\\mathbf1_A(x)=1\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_A(x)=0\">\\(\\mathbf1_A(x)=0\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin A\">\\(x\\notin A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}\\)</span> 是下式的实数候选值集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S\\)</span> 不额外要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是概率测度：原输入域内存在实上确界时保留其值，候选值无界时该实值关系为假。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\Sigma,[0,1])\\quad\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\nu(A(j)):\\ n\\in\\omega\\land a\\in[0,1]^n\\land A\\in\\Sigma^n\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\mathbf1_{A(j)}(x)\\leq h(x)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\Sigma,[0,1])\\quad\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\nu(A(j)):\\ n\\in\\omega\\land a\\in[0,1]^n\\land A\\in\\Sigma^n\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\mathbf1_{A(j)}(x)\\leq h(x)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}integral}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S(r,h;X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\Sigma,[0,1])\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\;u\\leq r\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\;u\\leq b)\\to r\\leq b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}integral}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S(r,h;X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\Sigma,[0,1])\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\;u\\leq r\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\;u\\leq b)\\to r\\leq b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land0\\in I\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P_\\bullet,I,([0,1]^\\Sigma)^X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(P_\\bullet(t),X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(s+t\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\exists h,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\nh(y)=P_\\bullet(t)(y)(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S\n(r,h;X,\\Sigma,P_\\bullet(s)(x))\n\\land P_\\bullet(s+t)(x)(A)=r\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\nP_\\bullet(0)(x)(A)=\\mathbf 1_A(x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land0\\in I\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P_\\bullet,I,([0,1]^\\Sigma)^X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(P_\\bullet(t),X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(s+t\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\exists h,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\nh(y)=P_\\bullet(t)(y)(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S\n(r,h;X,\\Sigma,P_\\bullet(s)(x))\n\\land P_\\bullet(s+t)(x)(A)=r\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\nP_\\bullet(0)(x)(A)=\\mathbf 1_A(x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The time set is an additive submonoid of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>, every value of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\bullet\">\\(P_\\bullet\\)</span> is a typed Markov kernel, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0\">\\(P_0\\)</span> is the identity kernel.</li>\n<li>The Chapman--Kolmogorov integral is now a bound value of an explicit nonnegative-integral relation. The former display used an unregistered integral term without binding its integrand or its kernel measure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md","status":"resolved","id":"b11853a4f3d4652b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md","status":"resolved","id":"b11853a4f3d4652b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S$ (probability-kernel predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,I,P_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_A(x)=1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_A(x)=0","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\Sigma,[0,1])\\quad\\to\\\\\n&\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\sum_{j<n}a(j)\\nu(A(j)):\\ n\\in\\omega\\land a\\in[0,1]^n\\land A\\in\\Sigma^n\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\sum_{j<n}a(j)\\mathbf1_{A(j)}(x)\\leq h(x)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}integral}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S(r,h;X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\Sigma,[0,1])\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\;u\\leq r\\\\\n&\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{KernelSimpleValues}_{58}(h,X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\\;u\\leq b)\\to r\\leq b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nI\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land0\\in I\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P_\\bullet,I,([0,1]^\\Sigma)^X)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(P_\\bullet(t),X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(s+t\\in I)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\exists h,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,[0,1])\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\nh(y)=P_\\bullet(t)(y)(A)\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\mathrm{KernelIntegral}_S\n(r,h;X,\\Sigma,P_\\bullet(s)(x))\n\\land P_\\bullet(s+t)(x)(A)=r\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\nP_\\bullet(0)(x)(A)=\\mathbf 1_A(x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"P_0","display":false}],"bytes":3191,"backlinks":[{"id":"c54ff90bd11c2ea4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S$ (canonical predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md]])"},{"id":"fc8c6ee52670b8eb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (transition-semigroup predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md|58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","b11853a4f3d4652b"]}